{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585900/extras/3Panel.gif?t=1748206770\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the summer of 1992, bored teen Vera Novak is tinkering with her homebrew HAM radio when she makes brief contact with cosmonaut Oleg Sergeev. It\u2019s the first in a strange series of events that will force her to re-examine her lone-wolf outlook on life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Gap Year, the story unfolds as you explore Vera\u2019s apartment, which is presented in comic book panels that expand, contract and re-orient themselves as you explore the space. You\u2019ll revisit the apartment four times throughout the course of a year, seeing changes in the environment reflect the passage of time between the game\u2019s four seasonal acts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A coming of age story complete with interstellar and inter-generational drama.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A unique point-and-click adventure that plays out through comic book panels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A beautifully rendered setting with hand-painted textures that transforms as the story unfolds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An engaging branching dialogue system that let\u2019s you influence the events of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585900/extras/Magnet.gif?t=1748206770\" /></div></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2585900?t=1748206770","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2585900?t=1748206770","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as